15.
The bye-laws of a co-operative society shall, subject to the provisions of the Act and the rules, cover the following
matters namely -
(i)
The name and headquarters of the society;
(ii)
the area of its operation;
(iii)
the primary objects of the society;
(iv)
the secondary objects of the society;
(v)
the extent, manner and terms for raising of funds and the minimum and maximum amount of share capital which a
member may hold;
(vi)
